---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Sections" description="What each Tunnelati section covers.">
  <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 2rem;">Sections</h1>
  <p class="muted">What each category on Tunnelati covers.</p>

  <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-category">Vegas Loop</span>
      <h2>Vegas Loop</h2>
      <p>Official developments on the Las Vegas underground transit system: new stations, entitlements, tunnels, airport connections, and operational updates from primary sources only.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-category">Nashville</span>
      <h2>Nashville (Music City Loop)</h2>
      <p>Music City Loop construction progress, Prufrock machines in Nashville, permits, station agreements, and official blog posts from The Boring Company.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-category">Machines</span>
      <h2>Machines</h2>
      <p>Prufrock tunnel boring machines, autonomous systems, liner trucks, power systems, and other vehicles or equipment demonstrated by official sources.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-category">Projects</span>
      <h2>Projects</h2>
      <p>Other cities and projects (Dubai Loop, future locations, competition winners, etc.) when announced or updated by official The Boring Company sources.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="card-category">Company</span>
      <h2>Company</h2>
      <p>Company-level updates: hiring, partnerships, safety training, official statements, and organisational news from primary sources.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>